    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Her tummy is soft, and there's no lump, and her spine looks completely normal, no dimples or hair.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:07",
      "end_timestamp": "04:17",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]",
        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Nothing is wrong, in the sense of disease. This is what we call primary nocturnal enuresis, a delay in the bladder and brain working together at night.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:22",
      "end_timestamp": "04:39",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Most do. But at eight, with her upset, we can help. I'd like to arrange a urine test today, to check for sugar or infection, to be certain.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:49",
      "end_timestamp": "05:05",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And treatment starts with simple measures. Drink most fluids earlier in the day, less after six, go to the toilet just before bed, and avoid fizzy drinks and squash in the evening.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:11",
      "end_timestamp": "05:26",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "A reward chart for dry nights, not punishment. And no blame, ever.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:32",
      "end_timestamp": "05:38",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    },
